While Ignis slumbered amidst the clouds, Terra reached up and plucked the Astral Heart. She dragged it down to her darkest caverns, intending to encase it within a massive crystal geode to nurture eternal warmth. But the delicate celestial gem could not endure the crushing pressure of the subterranean vault. As she sealed the chamber, the Heart shattered with a deafening crack.

The finest glowing dust escaped, drifting upward to paint the starry arc of the Milky Way. The heavy, weeping liquid core flooded the deep valleys, pooling into vast, cold oceans.

Devastated by the betrayal, Ignis dissolved into the roaring Hurricane, endlessly battering Terra’s spires to reclaim his shattered light.
